---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  lang="en"
  title="Services - Jiangsu Jiahong Int'l Freight Forwarding"
  description="Ocean & air freight, domestic trucking, warehousing, container yards and customs clearance — full-service import/export forwarding by Jiangsu Jiahong."
>
  <!-- Page hero -->
  <section class="page-hero has-img air">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/en">Home</a> / Services</div>
      <h1>Full-Service Coverage</h1>
      <p>One-stop import/export forwarding across sea, land, air, warehouse and customs.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Service details -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="svc">
        <div class="item reveal">
          <div class="ic"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M3 16V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9l6 6v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2Z"/><path d="M9 8v8M15 8v8M3 12h18"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h3>01 · Ocean Freight</h3>
            <p>Competitive rates on Southeast Asia, Middle East/India, Mediterranean, Europe/US, Red Sea and South America; agency at major ports with door-to-door service. Contracted rates with 12 carriers incl. Maersk, COSCO and CMA CGM.</p>
            <ul class="tags"><li>FCL</li><li>LCL</li><li>12 Carrier Rates</li><li>Door-to-Door</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item reveal" data-delay="80">
          <div class="ic"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M2 12l9-7 9 7M4 12v7h16v-7M9 19v-5h6v5"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h3>02 · Air Freight</h3>
            <p>Three consolidation hubs in Shanghai, Beijing/Tianjin and Guangzhou/Shenzhen as core agent for major airlines, ensuring fast global delivery.</p>
            <ul class="tags"><li>3 Hubs</li><li>Airline Agent</li><li>Global Direct</li><li>Express Air</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item reveal">
          <div class="ic"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M3 7h11v8H3zM14 10h4l3 3v2h-7z"/><circle cx="7" cy="17" r="2"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="2"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h3>03 · Domestic Trucking</h3>
            <p>60 own GPS-tracked trucks for import/export containers and LCL, nationwide transport at the most economical cost.</p>
            <ul class="tags"><li>60 Own Trucks</li><li>GPS Tracking</li><li>Container/LCL</li><li>Nationwide</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item reveal" data-delay="80">
          <div class="ic"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M4 21V8l8-4 8 4v13M4 21h16M9 21v-6h6v6"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h3>04 · Warehousing</h3>
            <p>20,000㎡ modern warehouse, 7×24, with storage, stuffing, sorting, labeling, palletizing and value-added services; dedicated textile warehouse, fully monitored.</p>
            <ul class="tags"><li>20,000㎡</li><li>7×24</li><li>Textile WH</li><li>Value-Added</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item reveal">
          <div class="ic"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M3 9h18v10H3zM7 9V6h10v3M9 13h6"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h3>05 · Container Yards</h3>
            <p>5 contracted international CYs, 40,000㎡+, 5,000 TEU/day, with reach stackers and forklifts; pre-pickup, drop-off, pre-booked container No. and professional repair & wash.</p>
            <ul class="tags"><li>5 Yards</li><li>40,000㎡</li><li>5,000 TEU/day</li><li>Repair & Wash</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item reveal" data-delay="80">
          <div class="ic"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 3l8 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V7l8-4Z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h3>06 · Customs Clearance</h3>
            <p>Expert team knows each port's policy; full tracking from booking to arrival; 96.88% clearance; container/inspection issues coordinated for smooth passage.</p>
            <ul class="tags"><li>96.88% Clear</li><li>Full Tracking</li><li>Inspection Coord.</li><li>Compliance</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process -->
  <section class="section soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">SERVICE PROCESS</span>
        <h2>Our Service Process</h2>
        <p>A standard, controllable five-step import/export flow.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step reveal"><div class="badge">1</div><h4>Quote</h4><p>Fast response with the best contracted rates.</p></div>
        <div class="step reveal" data-delay="80"><div class="badge">2</div><h4>Booking</h4><p>Booking, container pickup, receiving and documentation.</p></div>
        <div class="step reveal" data-delay="160"><div class="badge">3</div><h4>Customs</h4><p>Professional customs; 96.88% clearance rate.</p></div>
        <div class="step reveal" data-delay="240"><div class="badge">4</div><h4>Tracking</h4><p>From sailing to arrival, full tracking and feedback.</p></div>
        <div class="step reveal" data-delay="320"><div class="badge">5</div><h4>Delivery</h4><p>Destination clearance and delivery, signed off.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section cta-band has-img ship">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Not Sure Which Fits You?</h2>
      <p>Tell us your cargo and destination; our advisor will match the best combination and quote.</p>
      <a href="/en/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get Your Plan →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
